When user says 收工 / 写日志 / daily log:

1. Write or update `docs/daily-logs/YYYY-MM-DD.md`
2. `git add -A && git commit -m "docs: daily log YYYY-MM-DD"`
3. `git push origin <current-branch>` — **origin** is skylerzhen personal repo

User only says **收工**. Do not ask them to write markdown manually.

Team source remains on `upstream` (Codejoy-Lab/a7-ai-recorder).
